  "reflectionText": "Moses said to Israel: hear, O Israel. The Lord is our God. The Lord is one. You shall love the Lord your God with all your heart, with all your soul, and with all your might. Bind these words on your hand. Write them on the doorposts. What is it to be told that the One you love is one, and that the loving is to be done with everything you are at the same time?"
